    "notes": {
        "524a61c0-8521-4dfe-afa8-df11fd0d4394": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 400,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe flow needs **at least one open job** in Greenhouse whose interview plan has at least two stages (every plan starts with Application Review). It creates a candidate with an application on the first open job, advances it to the next stage, rejects it with the first rejection reason and deletes the candidate at the end. No rejection email is sent. List Offers stores the offers to a CSV file, so it passes even when the account has no offers.\n\nThe API credential needs the candidate, application, job, job stage, rejection reason and offer permissions."
        }
    }
